~ amador_intro

Amador: My head.. it [shake]hurts[/shake].

Amador: Wh... [wait=1] What am I doing here? [wait=2] Hold on, isn't this my [shake]basement?[/shake] 

??: [pulse]Look around, Amador[/pulse] 

=> END

